    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Embody Deific Forces of Death</p></blockquote><p>The Grave Domain watches over the boundary between life and death. For those who draw on it, death is a natural and inevitable part of the multiverse; these Clerics destroy undead and guide spirits on.</p><p>Its magic also lets them hold death off for a while—a delay, never a denial, for the grave always claims its due.</p><h3>Grave Domain Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ufPluhN2ElVmVcz2]{Grave Domain Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.DBQf2V4CeuXEpBZ2]{Circle of Mortality}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.y63LohGcEa41Z7JA]{Path to the Grave}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.eVMFclBC7C8nQPOF]{Sentinel at Death's Door}</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.wYiK2yzN5fTEAKvU]{Divine Reaper}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Grave Domain Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Cleric Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDetectEvil]{Detect Evil and Good}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFalseLife0]{False Life}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGentleRepo]{Gentle Repose}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRayofEnfee]{Ray of Enfeeblement}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplSparetheDy]{Spare the Dying}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRevivify00]{Revivify}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplVampiricTo]{Vampiric Touch}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBlight0000]{Blight}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDeathWard0]{Death Ward}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDispelEvil]{Dispel Evil and Good}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRaiseDead0]{Raise Dead}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
